<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίθημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>something put on</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίθεμα</span>): hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>. <i>lid</i>, <i>cover</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωριαμῶν ἐπιθήματα</span>
			<i>lids</i> of chests, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.228
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				68.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1408
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδα ἐ. τῷ φρέατι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					295
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐπ. τῆς χύτρας ἀφελών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hegesipp.Com.
					1.13
				</span></i>
			; <i>slab</i>, used as the top of a table, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.49a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>monument, sepulchral</i>
			<i>figure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
			<i>head</i> of a spear, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>.
			<i>device</i> on a shield, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.25.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>. Medic.,
				<i>application</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
